# Next.js agent rules — regenerated on every `next dev` since 16.3
# (set `agentRules: false` in next.config.js to stop generating them).
# Scoped to apps/ on purpose: the root CLAUDE.md and .agents/AGENTS.md are
# authored and tracked.
apps/*/AGENTS.md
apps/*/CLAUDE.md

